This qualification also allows students the opportunity
to gain broad, transferable skills and experiences that
can be applied as they progress into their next stages
of study and life and to enhance their preparation for
future employment.

Students will have the opportunity to develop and
demonstrate the following skills that are transferable to
different real-life contexts, roles or employment:

•

•

